window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Jaxon and Grace's story continues in </b><b><i>New York Times</i></b><b> best-selling author Tracy Wolff's captivating sequel to </b><b><i>Crave</i></b><b>. </b></p> <p>I'm in the fight of my life. For my humanity. For Jaxon. And for the world I've only just begun to be a part of. I'm all in, even if saving the people I love means I risk losing myself forever.</p>"; 
